  "name": null,
  "problem": "The vectors ${a}_{1},$ ${a}_{2},$ and ${a}_{3}$ are given below. Determine whether $B=\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2}\\}$ is a basis of $\\text{Span}\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}.$ If that is the case, find ${x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2},$ where ${a}_{3}={x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}.$\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
